{"words": [{"text": "تِلْكَ", "translation": "These"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتُ", "translation": "(are the) Verses"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "نَتْلُوهَا", "translation": "We recite them"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكَ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ", "translation": "in [the] truth"}, {"text": "وَإِنَّكَ", "translation": "And indeed, you"}, {"text": "لَمِنَ", "translation": "(are) surely of"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "translation": "the Messengers"}], "sahih": "These are the verses of Allāh which We recite to you, [O Muḥammad], in truth. And indeed, you are from among the messengers."}